%% VOTAR-373 — Trazabilidad on-chain auditable (fix Alchemy eth_getLogs)
%% UAT-01: tabla cronológica en /dashboard/transacciones
%% UAT-02: links Etherscan verificables
%% Patrón VOTAR-433: índice append-only, sin scan masivo en lectura

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Votante
  actor Auditor
  participant BUD as BUD / vote-transmitter
  participant Dash as Dashboard Público<br/>(/dashboard/transacciones)
  participant API as API Backend
  participant Idx as TransaccionBlockchainService
  participant BC as BlockchainService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>(transaccion_blockchain)
  participant RPC as Sepolia RPC

  Note over Votante,RPC: Flujo A — Escritura (voto confirmado)
  Votante->>BUD: Confirma sufragio firmado
  BUD->>RPC: castSignedVote → SignedVoteCast
  RPC-->>BUD: txHash + blockNumber
  BUD->>API: POST /votos/transaccion-publica { txHash }<br/>(credentials: omit)
  API->>Idx: registrarVotoPublico(id, txHash)
  Idx->>BC: getVoteParticipationByTxHash(txHash)
  BC->>RPC: eth_getTransactionReceipt (1 RPC)
  RPC-->>BC: receipt + SignedVoteCast
  Idx->>BC: parseElectionTransactionAuditEntry
  Idx->>PG: INSERT idempotente (sin nullifier/voterHash)

  Note over Auditor,PG: Flujo B — Lectura (auditor)
  Auditor->>Dash: Abre solapa Transacciones
  Dash->>API: GET /elecciones/:id/transacciones-publica
  API->>Idx: listarPorEleccion(id)
  Idx->>PG: SELECT ORDER BY numero_bloque
  PG-->>Dash: filas + explorerUrl
  Dash-->>Auditor: Tabla cronológica (UAT-01)
  Auditor->>RPC: Click Etherscan (UAT-02)

  Note over Dash,RPC: Sin eth_getLogs / queryFilter en lectura del dashboard
